
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>CENCH | Official Website</title>

<style>
* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

body {
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  background: #fff;
  color: #171717;
}

header {
  padding: 22px 8%;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
}

.logo {
  font-size: 27px;
  font-weight: 900;
  letter-spacing: 3px;
}

.logo span { color: #c49a35; }

nav a {
  color: #222;
  text-decoration: none;
  margin-left: 22px;
  font-size: 14px;
}

.hero {
  min-height: 75vh;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 50px 20px;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff, #f6f0e3);
}

.hero small {
  color: #ad842b;
  letter-spacing: 5px;
  font-weight: bold;
}

.hero h1 {
  font-size: clamp(65px, 12vw, 120px);
  margin: 18px 0;
  letter-spacing: 8px;
}

.hero h1 span { color: #c49a35; }

.hero p {
  color: #666;
  font-size: 18px;
  margin-bottom: 30px;
}

.btn {
  display: inline-block;
  background: #c49a35;
  color: white;
  padding: 14px 30px;
  text-decoration: none;
  border-radius: 5px;
  font-weight: bold;
}

section {
  padding: 75px 8%;
  text-align: center;
}

section h2 {
  font-size: 32px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

section h2 span { color: #c49a35; }

.about p {
  max-width: 650px;
  margin: auto;
  color: #666;
  line-height: 1.8;
}

.games {
  background: #f8f6f1;
}

.game-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
  gap: 20px;
  margin-top: 35px;
}

.game {
  padding: 35px 15px;
  background: white;
  border: 1px solid #e8dfca;
  border-radius: 10px;
}

.game h3 { color: #b18a34; }

.socials a {
  display: inline-block;
  margin: 10px;
  padding: 13px 22px;
  border: 1px solid #c49a35;
  border-radius: 5px;
  color: #222;
  text-decoration: none;
}

footer {
  background: #171717;
  color: white;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 25px;
}

footer span { color: #d3ad56; }

@media(max-width: 600px) {
  header { flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; }
  nav a { margin: 0 7px; }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <div class="logo">CENCH<span>.</span></div>
  <nav>
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#games">Gaming</a>
    <a href="#socials">Socials</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<div class="hero" id="home">
  <small>WELCOME TO MY WORLD</small>
  <h1>CEN<span>CH</span></h1>
  <p>Gamer. Creator. Different Level.</p>
  <a href="#about" class="btn">EXPLORE MY WORLD</a>
</div>

<section class="about" id="about">
  <h2>ABOUT <span>CENCH</span></h2>
  <p>
    Welcome to my official website. I'm Cench, a gamer
    passionate about gaming, entertainment and creativity.
    This is my space to share my gaming journey and connect
    with people around the world.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="games" id="games">
  <h2>MY <span>GAMING WORLD</span></h2>
  <p>Welcome to my gaming universe.</p>
  <div class="game-grid">
    <div class="game">
      <h3>GAMING</h3>
      <p>My gaming journey.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="game">
      <h3>VIDEOS</h3>
      <p>Gaming content and highlights.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="game">
      <h3>COMMUNITY</h3>
      <p>Connecting with other gamers.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="socials" id="socials">
  <h2>CONNECT WITH <span>ME</span></h2>
  <p>Follow my journey online.</p>
  <a href="#">Instagram</a>
  <a href="#">TikTok</a>
  <a href="#">YouTube</a>
</section>

<footer>
  <p>© 2026 <span>CENCH</span>. All Rights Reserved.</p>
  <p>Built with passion.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
